{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54765","headline":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 二十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 二十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"军营内，星陨落其间。\n拽尾或长三五尺（辛本、川本、京本作「丈」），皆爲败阵（辛本、川本、京本作「证」）莫（京本作「欲」）相残，急去免灾（京本作「凶」）奸。\n（孔明、祖逖皆有此兆。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54765.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54765","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}